  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 5 minutes from start to finish. The key thing to watch is keeping the heat low and giving each vegetable time to soften into the pan before you stir in the next one, so the flavours build in layers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Salt the aubergine and courgette lightly before cooking and pat them dry. It removes excess moisture so the vegetables roast in the pan rather than steam."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
